  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_025suz_1_5_025_01:1_5_025_01:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_025suz_1_5_025_01:1_5_025_01:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_025suz_1_5_025_01:1_5_025_01:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_025suz_1_5_025_01:1_5_025_01:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fa2a655d2b85c70fd642b52519b60321bbbdb826f55f85b256583a173f51023",
      "text": "发蜡CM拍摄的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_025suz_1_5_025_01:1_5_025_01:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7461b9033e4b48ef3f3f3a8d1da88899dfe43b154fd5f28ec2e8d0118813fd3",
      "text": "朱雀先生，这是前几天提到的，\n拍摄CM要用的发蜡样品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_025suz_1_5_025_01:1_5_025_01:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5f044b5cfc0d757e7d4f00875e1cee22f22b25f8aa15b5b74ca7cbb876559f6",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，谢啦！\n这就是新款发蜡啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_025suz_1_5_025_01:1_5_025_01:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23622f69c52a02827b4debeb72f4b60abea8100aa762dc44984d8f0abb503e4f",
      "text": "嘿嘿，听说能拿到样品之后，\n我就一直在期待到底是什么样的好东西了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_025suz_1_5_025_01:1_5_025_01:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17f916b620941b9afbf05e030119ca72ba689fd4fb58d877462fd75fd91d15cd",
      "text": "包装帅呆了！\n好嘞，马上来试用一下看看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_025suz_1_5_025_01:1_5_025_01:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f452a349aa4284b6da83fd8b4cf67ff1606996ba9ece8926721f30763e61bbb",
      "text": "喔喔喔！？这、这是什么啊……\n定型也太容易了吧！太厉害了！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_025suz_1_5_025_01:1_5_025_01:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fd6f602faab6a3d8b6e90acc506672a6fe7785a63e48641366c6c5bbfd2ca7d",
      "text": "负责人说，这款在上一代发蜡的基础上\n进行了反复改良。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_025suz_1_5_025_01:1_5_025_01:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acd32bc869d01a3c2eb2ccbd821575ed9efbfcc55fd1aed4613276e954ac842c",
      "text": "这样啊……果然和宣传语说的一样，\n一下子就把发型定好了，真不是盖的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_025suz_1_5_025_01:1_5_025_01:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:234dc497ae537463211352d1c447e3e98b500eddd8bf8fb0237ea180d94ed942",
      "text": "哎，我怎么光顾着说厉害了。\n不过，是真的有那么厉害啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_025suz_1_5_025_01:1_5_025_01:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d71ca06f31d7d1e40ed37b9e1c7fbcded020be38a098bdce25aa420ef5602629",
      "text": "拍摄是在下周。为了能充分展现出\n发蜡的魅力，一起加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_025suz_1_5_025_01:1_5_025_01:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a39fd6ff051febc457c4932df58ed55c0861806396870fe109c10fd27c72e3ec",
      "text": "哦！喔喔喔，豁出去了！\n燃起来了，Burning！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
